            </note>
            <note corresp="#d607-f2" n="16" xml:id="d607-f2-content">
                <p>Loan contract of October 6, 1922, between the Republic of Haiti and the National
                    City Company and the National City Bank, both of New York; for text, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Le Moniteur, Journal Officiel de la République
                        d’Haiti</hi>, October 30, 1922; for correspondence relating to the loan, see
                        <ref target="frus1922v02#pg_472">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1922, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp. 472</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d607-f3" n="17" xml:id="d607-f3-content">
                <p>Department of State Executive Agreement Series No. 128, or 53 Stat. 1923.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d607-f4" n="18" xml:id="d607-f4-content">
                <p>Sidney de la Rue, Fiscal Representative of the Haitian Government.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
